{
  "_about": "CARD2D trial (spec 25 §1): resource props as flat camera-facing cards baked from the 3D GLBs. Each entry names one GLB, the sway kind it uses, the families that use it and, after a bake, the texture geometry. card_bake.gd (--lab=card_bake) renders game/assets/nature/cards/<name>_albedo.png and <name>_normal.png and rewrites pivot/world_size/content/baked below; the other keys are hand-edited and kept. pivot is the ground point in normalized texture UV (u from the left, v from the top); world_size is the whole texture rectangle in metres at scale 1; content is the visible part in texture pixels. Buildings stay 3D (out of scope).",
  "_kinds": "Only trees and grasses sway. Bushes, plants, branch piles, and rocks remain still. Amplitude is the tip's sideways travel in metres.",
